PLLE2_ADV connectivity violation. The signal mig_wrapper0/u_mig_7series_0/u_mig_7series_0_mig/u_ddr3_infrastructure/pll_clk3_out on the mig_wrapper0/u_mig_7series_0/u_mig_7series_0_mig/u_ddr3_infrastructure/plle2_i/CLKOUT3 pin of mig_wrapper0/u_mig_7series_0/u_mig_7series_0_mig/u_ddr3_infrastructure/plle2_i does not drive the same kind of BUFFER load as the other CLKOUT pins. Routing from the different buffer types will not be phase aligned.
